you're making decisions on

00:15:14.514 --> 00:15:16.182
what is palpable and acceptable

00:15:16.182 --> 00:15:18.017
within an ecosystem 
that's created.

00:15:18.017 --> 00:15:20.987
I get it, I'm more 
empathetic to it.

00:15:20.987 --> 00:15:23.256
Here's the punchline though,
if you're doing something

00:15:23.256 --> 00:15:24.791
to grow within an organization,

00:15:24.791 --> 00:15:26.692
or not rock the boat, 
and have stability,

00:15:26.692 --> 00:15:29.095
