you're doing is right.

00:15:29.095 --> 00:15:30.696
It just means 
it's right for you,

00:15:30.696 --> 00:15:33.132
within the context of
the game that you chose.

00:15:33.132 --> 00:15:35.468
In that human vulnerability
is enormous amounts

00:15:35.468 --> 00:15:38.271
