I plan to exploit that.

00:15:38.271 --> 00:15:40.072
(laughing)

00:15:40.072 --> 00:15:42.041
- So in terms of that, you
have these conversations,

00:15:42.041 --> 00:15:43.943
but people just don't 
wanna change, right?

00:15:43.943 --> 00:15:46.445
So how do you make 
people change?

00:15:46.445 --> 00:15:47.747
You just keep doing you.
- You don't!

00:15:47.747 --> 00:15:48.581
You don't.

00:15:48.581 --> 00:15:50.416
I could care less 
if anybody changes,

00:15:50.416 --> 00:15:53.286
as a matter of fact, 
I prefer that nobody changes.

00:15:53.286 --> 00:15:55.121
Because when I get to
the second part of this,

00:15:55.121 --> 00:15:57.156
it'll give me more 
time to do my thing.

00:15:57.156 --> 00:16:00.593
