just, I mean, eventually--

00:16:15.675 --> 00:16:17.343
See, what's interesting 
for me is

00:16:17.343 --> 00:16:19.478
there's a whole next 
generation of people,

00:16:19.478 --> 00:16:21.247
like, and this is gonna
create business opportunities.

00:16:21.247 --> 00:16:22.949
I'm right, and everybody 
knows it,

00:16:22.949 --> 00:16:24.250
because you're right, 
you know it!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:26.018
I'm not a genius!

00:16:26.018 --> 00:16:28.855
I'm just in a situation where
