00:16:51.544 --> 00:16:53.813
(laughing)

00:16:56.983 --> 00:16:59.685
So I don't know, 
like, it's interesting.

00:16:59.685 --> 00:17:01.287
And this happens 
everywhere, like,

00:17:01.287 --> 00:17:03.222
I yell at kids to not 
